    <string name="about_text">IA64-Emu is an experimental IA-64 virtual machine app for Android. It runs the QEMU IA-64 fork by syunnPC inside PRoot.\n\nQEMU and the IA-64 firmware are licensed under the GNU GPL v2. PRoot is licensed under the GNU GPL v2. Guest operating systems and firmware images are not included; supply them under their own licenses.\n\nThe IA-64 target is experimental and TCG emulation is slow. Use a 64-bit device with at least 8 GiB of RAM for desktop guests.</string>

